{"id":"e819ca0a85388cbb","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-degree-pseudocomplement.md","title":"Pseudocomplement in the Degree Order","display":"df-degree-pseudocomplement — Pseudocomplement in the Degree Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement","aliases":["67-df-degree-pseudocomplement"],"display":"df-degree-pseudocomplement — Pseudocomplement in the Degree Order","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-thm-degree-structure]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§1","source_label":"pseudocomplement definition, recalling Chapter 1 p20","source_printed_pages":[99],"source_pdf_pages":[110],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-definition-checked; local-single-valuedness-proof-recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-degree-pseudocomplement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-pseudocomplement — Pseudocomplement in the Degree Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89eac554f6aa8842\" href=\"?note=89eac554f6aa8842\" title=\"67-thm-degree-structure\">67-thm-degree-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"pseudocomplement definition, recalling Chapter 1 p20"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>99</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>110</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-definition-checked; local-single-valuedness-proof-recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T\">\\(D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a> 的固定基础理论及度序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in D_T\">\\(a,b\\in D_T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Disj}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Disj}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PC}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PC}_T\\)</span> 为下面定义的二元谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pc}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{pc}_T\\)</span> 是部分函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,b)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\forall x\\in D_T\\;((x\\leq_Ta\\land x\\leq_Tb)\\to x=\\mathbf0_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,b)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\forall x\\in D_T\\;((x\\leq_Ta\\land x\\leq_Tb)\\to x=\\mathbf0_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\left(\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,b)\\land\\forall c\\in D_T\\;(\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,c)\\to c\\leq_Tb)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\left(\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,b)\\land\\forall c\\in D_T\\;(\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,c)\\to c\\leq_Tb)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pc}_T)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in D_T:\\exists b\\in D_T\\;\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pc}_T)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in D_T:\\exists b\\in D_T\\;\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}(\\operatorname{pc}_T)\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in D_T^2:\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{graph}(\\operatorname{pc}_T)\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in D_T^2:\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书第1章印刷20页（PDF31页）定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=\\max\\{c:a\\cap c=0\\}\">\\(b=\\max\\{c:a\\cap c=0\\}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的 pseudocomplement；第7章印刷99页（PDF110页）应用于解释度。这里用“共同下界只有底元”展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_Tb=\\mathbf0_T\">\\(a\\wedge_Tb=\\mathbf0_T\\)</span>，所以定义不预先依赖格运算存在。</p>\n<p>在原书的度格中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,b)\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_Tb=\\mathbf0_T\">\\(a\\wedge_Tb=\\mathbf0_T\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,b&#39;\">\\(b,b&#39;\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;\\cdot)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\leq_Tb&#39;\">\\(b\\leq_Tb&#39;\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b&#39;\\leq_Tb\">\\(b&#39;\\leq_Tb\\)</span>，由偏序反对称性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=b&#39;\">\\(b=b&#39;\\)</span>，故图确为部分函数；不主张每个度都在其定义域中。来源和签名已核对，局部唯一性论证如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"89eac554f6aa8842","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]] 的固定基础理论及度序。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Disj}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PC}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pc}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,b)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\forall x\\in D_T\\;((x\\leq_Ta\\land x\\leq_Tb)\\to x=\\mathbf0_T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\left(\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,b)\\land\\forall c\\in D_T\\;(\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,c)\\to c\\leq_Tb)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pc}_T)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in D_T:\\exists b\\in D_T\\;\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}(\\operatorname{pc}_T)\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in D_T^2:\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"b=\\max\\{c:a\\cap c=0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\wedge_Tb=\\mathbf0_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Disj}_T(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\wedge_Tb=\\mathbf0_T","display":false},{"tex":"b,b'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\leq_Tb'","display":false},{"tex":"b'\\leq_Tb","display":false},{"tex":"b=b'","display":false}],"bytes":2198,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5f6b697b0ac9e9c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,d_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathrm{PC}_T,\\operatorname{pc}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]] 与 [[67-df-degree-complexity]] 的定义及固定一致基础理论 $T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$。"},{"id":"7f3094a41722b9e6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathsf S_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{PC}_T$ 及部分函数 $\\operatorname{pc}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]；[[../67-thm-degree-splitting-density]]；[[../67-df-degree-complexity]]；[[../67-thm-degree-delta2]]；[[../67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]；[[../67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]；[[../67-df-degree-high-low]]；[[../67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]；[[../67-thm-degree-infinitary-distributivity]]；[[../67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap]]"}],"outgoing":["f5b9611e728efd8b","89eac554f6aa8842"]}